{
  "$comment": [
    "Shared cross-language round-trip fixture for the v1 annotation type",
    "matrix (docs/ANNOTATION_CONTRACT.md). One case per accepted type/payload",
    "variant. Consumed by:",
    "  - packages/ui-graph-canvas/tests/annotationTypeMatrix.test.js (JS model)",
    "  - backend/core/tests/test_annotation_type_matrix.py (backend model,",
    "    session persistence and the MCP tool surface)",
    "Each case's `fields` merge onto the annotation's top level exactly the",
    "way `annotationModel.js`'s per-type payload and",
    "`session_annotations.build_annotation`'s `content` argument both work,",
    "so the same case data drives both without translation. `image.fields.image.url`",
    "is a syntactically-embedded placeholder (matches the",
    "`data:image/webp;base64,` prefix the ingest guard requires) rather than a",
    "real ingested picture — exercising ingest itself is",
    "backend/service/tests/test_mcp_image_annotation_tool.py's job, not this",
    "fixture's; this matrix only checks that the object-model layer accepts",
    "and round-trips a syntactically valid embedded image payload."
  ],
  "schema_version": 1,
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "note-1",
      "type": "note",
      "x": 10,
      "y": 20,
      "w": 180,
      "h": 100,
      "fields": { "text": "A sticky note", "color": "#fbbf24", "fontSize": 14 }
    },
    {
      "id": "text-1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 40,
      "fields": {
        "text": "A heading",
        "attachment": { "target_id": "node-1", "target_type": "node", "anchor": "top" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "label-1",
      "type": "label",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 60,
      "fields": {
        "text": "A callout",
        "attachment": {
          "target_id": "node-2",
          "target_type": "node",
          "anchor": "right",
          "offset": { "x": 5, "y": -5 }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "line-1",
      "type": "line",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "fields": {
        "to": { "x": 100, "y": 0 },
        "startArrow": false,
        "endArrow": true,
        "start": { "point": { "x": 0, "y": 0 } },
        "end": { "attachment": { "target_id": "node-3", "target_type": "node" } }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "group-1",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 320,
      "h": 180,
      "fields": { "label": "A group", "member_node_ids": ["node-a", "node-b"] }
    },
    {
      "id": "shape-rectangle-1",
      "type": "shape",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 160,
      "h": 96,
      "fields": { "shape": "rectangle" }
    },
    {
      "id": "shape-process-arrow-1",
      "type": "shape",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 160,
      "h": 96,
      "rotation": 45,
      "fields": { "shape": "process_arrow" }
    },
    {
      "id": "icon-1",
      "type": "icon",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 80,
      "fields": {
        "icon": "flag",
        "attachment": { "target_id": "node-4", "target_type": "node" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "vote-dot-1",
      "type": "vote_dot",
      "x": 90,
      "y": 100,
      "fields": {
        "value": 3,
        "attachment": { "target_id": "node-5", "target_type": "node" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "image-1",
      "type": "image",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 200,
      "h": 150,
      "fields": {
        "image": {
          "url": "data:image/webp;base64,UklGRhoAAABXRUJQVlA4TA0AAAAvAAAAEAcQERGIiP4HAA==",
          "width": 200,
          "height": 150
        },
        "alt": "A diagram"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "freehand-1",
      "type": "freehand",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "fields": {
        "points": [
          { "x": 0, "y": 0, "pressure": 0.4 },
          { "x": 10, "y": 10, "pressure": 0.8 }
        ],
        "smoothing": 0.2,
        "strokeWidth": 3
      }
    }
  ]
}
